---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
---
<BaseLayout title="Veterinary and Content Disclaimer" description="PetWellHub's veterinary safety limits, emergency guidance, and source limitations">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24"><header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Legal · Disclaimer</p><h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Veterinary and Content Disclaimer</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>General education only</h2><p>PetWellHub provides general educational information for pet caregivers. Content is not a diagnosis, prescription, treatment plan, or substitute for examination by a licensed veterinarian who knows the animal's history.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Emergency boundary</h2><p>Contact an emergency veterinary service immediately for collapse, breathing difficulty, blue or very pale gums, seizures, severe bleeding, major trauma, suspected poisoning, inability to stand, repeated unproductive retching with abdominal enlargement, or rapid deterioration. In the United States, an animal poison-control service may charge a fee; use a number supplied by your veterinarian or an established service such as ASPCA Animal Poison Control or Pet Poison Helpline.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Medication and treatment boundary</h2><p>Do not start, stop, substitute, or change a medication dose based on this site. Product labels, local availability, contraindications, and patient needs change. Follow the prescribing veterinarian and the current official label.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Sources and uncertainty</h2><p>Linked sources are selected to support specific statements, but evidence can be limited, updated, or inapplicable to an individual animal. A source list does not establish clinical review by a named veterinarian, and illustrations do not document a real patient or test.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Report a suspected factual or safety error to <a class="underline" href="mailto:editor@petwellhub.org">editor@petwellhub.org</a>. The editorial address cannot triage an emergency or provide individualized veterinary advice.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
